<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tele-Communications.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tele-Communications.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it downgraded Tele-Communications Inc to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Tele-Communications lost 5/16 to 15-11/16.</p>
